# Player.events — smoke-test sheet for the bridge (Task 3 Part C verify).
# Put this next to Game.events; an actor named Player suffices: move is W-hold, space hops the counter.
# Hot reload (Part D) will refresh saves; for now the sheet attaches on play start.

when W is held
  move forward speed 40

when A is held
  move left speed 40

when D is held
  move right speed 40

when S is held
  move backward speed 40

when Space is pressed
  add 1 to Hops

when Hops becomes 3
  set text of HopsLabel to "three hops!"
